OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic failure was avoidable,
OL,4,Asays transport secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA technical failure of the UK's air
OL,7,Ftraffic control system that has caused
OL,8,Fwidespread flight chaos was avoidable,
OL,9,Faccording to the Transport Secretary.
OL,11,FHeidi Alexander told the Commons she
OL,12,Fhad ordered an independent
OL,13,Finvestigation by the aviation watchdog
OL,14,Finto the system operated by Nats, which
OL,15,Fwent down for four hours on Tuesday.
OL,17,FMore than 2,000 flights have been
OL,18,Fcancelled as disruption continued for a
OL,19,Fsecond day with passengers stuggling to
OL,20,Ffly out of and into the UK.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
