OL,3,GNEWSAAir traffic failure was avoidable,
OL,4,Asays transport secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter meeting with the boss of Nats,
OL,7,FMartin Rolfe, Alexander said a
OL,8,Fcyberattack could be ruled out, but she
OL,9,Fadded: "I do not believe this issue was
OL,10,Funavoidable."
